Z||000000||Elenor84||02-01-2001||01:40 AM||||Hey guys, My question of the week on my website was, "How fast have u gone in your fier"?  Now...I gave options from 120km/h all the way to 200km/h+...the answer that one by the most votes was 200km/h+...trailing in second place was 120km/h and then 140km/h and 170km/h were tied...Now The question is...I'm pritty sure that u would need a v8 to go 200km/h true?  And about the 170km/h...is that possible with a 5 speed in a 4clyinder car or do u need the 5 speed?  Or do u need to go all the way up to a v6?  Thx...I have gone 140km/h in my car..thas pritty much maxed out..<BR>thx guys!<P>------------------<BR>Lance<BR>Click Image to go to site.<BR><A HREF="http://members.nbci.com/_XMCM/lancegspage/Index.html" TARGET=_blank><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sideview.jpg">  </A>||||reg||1
Z||000001||DaRkLoRD||02-01-2001||03:57 AM||||a V8 to go 200kph?? not even close..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>a 4cyl can reach that no problem.. maybe not the *FIERO* 4cyl, but a Talon, Prelude, etc could easily top 200.<P>I've gone pretty close to 200 in a full-sized car with a regular (non HO) 2.8 and it still had power... we ran out of road.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||10
Z||000002||Elenor84||02-01-2001||05:43 AM||||But I'm not talking about "other cars"  I'm talking about fiero's...anyone else?<P>------------------<BR>Lance<BR>Click Image to go to site.<BR><A HREF="http://members.nbci.com/_XMCM/lancegspage/Index.html" TARGET=_blank><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sideview.jpg">  </A>||||reg||1
