Z||000004||crzyone||02-01-2001||09:12 AM||||I think the top speed of a Fiero GT is 140 miles an hour isn't it.  I thought I read that.  That translates to 220 KM/H.  Come on, I've had a dodge caravan up to 200...   If a Fiero can get to 90 miles an hour in the quarter mile I'm sure it could go fairly quick on a long stretch.   <P>------------------<BR>86 GT<BR>85 2M4||||reg||1
Z||000005||ChadMan||02-01-2001||09:34 AM||||The top speed of my 88 Coupe/5sp is 108 mph, so I voted for 170 kph.  170 kph is equal to about 106, right?<P>I reached this speed on a nearly deserted section of I-77 between Marietta and Cambridge, OH, on a sunny Saturday morning.  No animals were harmed in the making of this motion picture.  Dealer contribution may affect consumer cost.||||reg||1
Z||000006||Phil||02-01-2001||10:02 AM||||My speed limiter stops me at 120 MPH which is 193 KPH. The car was still pulling quite well up to that point too.<P>------------------<BR> <BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_1.gif">  <BR>SC 3800||||reg||1
Z||000007||bHooper||02-01-2001||10:49 AM||||I have been 118 mph in my then bone stock '86 GT 5 speed!<P>btw, Lance, i never noticed that youi were from Edmonton... I'm a <B>HUGE</B> Oiler fan!<P><P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT<BR>KYB's, Eibach's,<BR>Poly Bushings||||reg||1
Z||000008||Old Lar||02-01-2001||12:05 PM||||When my 5 speed GT was a lot newer, I had it up to 120 mph = 193 kph. I chickened out after that.  I was at a little over 4000 rpm.  I would have needed a longer straight away to continue.  And some better balanced tires.||||reg||3
Z||000009||Johnson's85SE||02-01-2001||01:48 PM||||Hi,<BR> I had my 1985 SE pin'd around to about 5kms. Then my engine oil broke down, and my engine quit. Now I got a new engine and will never attempt anything even close to that. I only have a 140KM speedo, So my guesstimation would be between 165-180 kMS that night. I thought long and hard about my misstake as I walked 20KMs to my house at 3:00AM, down the highway. Cheers!<BR>Chris   <P>------------------<BR>If it isn't broke, it's not my car.||||reg||13
